# Still screenshots only; the GIF this writes is thrown away.
Output "/tmp/org-nvim-shots.gif"
Source docs/media/tapes/common.tape

Hide
Type "export ORG_DEMO_DIR=/tmp/org-demo-shots; clear; nvim -u docs/media/demo/init.lua $ORG_DEMO_DIR/markup.org" Enter
